/-!
# A055215

A path-counting array, read by rows: T(i,j)=number of paths from (0,0) to (i-j,j) using steps (1 unit right and 1 unit up) or (1 unit right and 2 units up).

The 87 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A055215

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1,
    1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2,
    1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 4, 2, 1, 1, 1,
